<section class="page-h"><div class="wrap"><h1>What we believe</h1><p class="lede">Everything we do is rooted in the Word of God.</p></div></section>

<section class="wrap vm">
 <div><h2>Our vision</h2><p>To see vibrant, Bible-based churches planted across Kenya and beyond, and communities transformed in body and soul by the gospel of Jesus Christ.</p></div>
 <div><h2>Our mission</h2><p>BBCC exists to love God, love people and live out the Great Commission. We plant churches, share the living water of Christ through Jacob’s Well, care for children at Nuru Toto, restore hearts through Renewed Hearts Association, and train believers at Hybells Christian School.</p></div>
</section>

